WEBVTT

00:00:04.368 --> 00:00:07.154
He's busy out there
protecting the Valley.
他忙着保护这一带的相亲

00:00:07.328 --> 00:00:09.460
- [gasps] The Dragon Warrior!
- There he is.
龙战士！

00:00:09.635 --> 00:00:11.332
- Po!
- Wow!
阿宝！

00:00:12.202 --> 00:00:13.726
Uh... Uh, here.
这里

00:00:13.900 --> 00:00:15.249
- [giggling]
- OK, OK.
乖孩子

00:00:15.423 --> 00:00:16.467
You should have
told me you were coming.
要回来早点通知我呀 给爹请安

00:00:16.642 --> 00:00:17.991
Hi, Dad.
要回来早点通知我呀 给爹请安

00:00:18.165 --> 00:00:19.906
I would have saved you some
stinky tofu.
好让我给你留点臭豆腐呀

00:00:20.080 --> 00:00:21.647
Uh... Uh...
好让我给你留点臭豆腐呀

00:00:21.821 --> 00:00:25.433
- Dad, can I talk to you?
- Of course, son.
爹，能跟你说句话么？ 当然可以，儿子

00:00:25.607 --> 00:00:30.220
In honor of my son,
free tofu dessert
for everybody!
托我儿子的福，
本店拿免费凉拌豆腐招待大家！

00:00:30.394 --> 00:00:32.005
- [cheering]
- With purchases.
随点菜附送

00:00:32.179 --> 00:00:33.180
[all groan]
随点菜附送

00:00:33.354 --> 00:00:36.966
Oh, it's so good
to see you, Po.
阿宝，爹看你回来了多高兴啊

00:00:37.140 --> 00:00:40.709
Have you lost weight? I can
almost put my wings
around you.
你减肥了？我的翅膀都能把你抱住

00:00:40.883 --> 00:00:42.537
Ah, well, maybe a little.
可能减了一点点

00:00:42.711 --> 00:00:45.018
Poor you, you must feel weak.
阿宝，你肯定会觉得身子虚，
爹去给你盛碗汤

00:00:45.192 --> 00:00:47.629
- Let me get you some soup.
- No, that's OK, Dad.
阿宝，你肯定会觉得身子虚，
爹去给你盛碗汤

00:00:47.803 --> 00:00:49.675
- I'm not hungry.
- Not hungry?
不饿？阿宝，你没病吧？

00:00:49.849 --> 00:00:51.415
Po, are you all right?
不饿？阿宝，你没病吧？

00:00:51.589 --> 00:00:53.330
Yeah. No, I'm fine.
I just...
我好好的，只是…

00:00:53.504 --> 00:00:55.506
Earlier today,
I was fighting these bandits.
今天上午我正跟土匪交战，没啥大不了

00:00:55.681 --> 00:00:58.161
- Uh-huh.
- Nothing too dangerous.
今天上午我正跟土匪交战，没啥大不了

00:00:58.335 --> 00:00:59.989
- They were just, you know...
- Yeah.
他们只是…

00:01:00.163 --> 00:01:02.209
And then the strangest thing
happened.
然后出了件怪事，我似乎看到了

00:01:02.383 --> 00:01:04.298
I had this crazy vision.
然后出了件怪事，我似乎看到了

00:01:04.472 --> 00:01:07.518
I think I saw my mom
and me... as a baby.
我看见我娘抱着宝宝时的我

00:01:07.693 --> 00:01:10.826
What? Huh?
Mom? A baby?
娘？宝宝？

00:01:11.000 --> 00:01:15.526
- Um, Dad?
- What are you talking about?
你说的都是啥话？

00:01:15.701 --> 00:01:17.528
- What...?
- How do I say this?
要我怎么说？

00:01:17.703 --> 00:01:19.052
[whimpers]

00:01:19.226 --> 00:01:21.184
Where did I come from?
我从哪儿抱来的？

00:01:25.145 --> 00:01:30.759
Well, you see, uh, son, baby
geese come from a little egg.
小鹅是从鹅蛋来的

00:01:30.933 --> 00:01:33.066
Don't ask me
where the egg comes from.
别问我鹅蛋是哪儿来的!

00:01:33.240 --> 00:01:35.721
Dad, that's not what I meant.
爹，我不是这个意思

00:01:37.070 --> 00:01:39.246
I know it's not.
我知道不是

00:01:39.420 --> 00:01:44.294
I think it's time I told you
something I should have told
you a long time ago.
是时候了，我早就该对你说明白了

00:01:45.295 --> 00:01:46.557
OK.
好

00:01:46.732 --> 00:01:49.560
You might have been kind of...
你说不定是…

00:01:49.735 --> 00:01:52.085
...a... a... a...
你说不定是…

00:01:54.043 --> 00:01:55.697
...adopted.
抱来的

00:01:55.871 --> 00:01:57.699
- I knew it.
- You knew?
我知道

00:01:57.873 --> 00:02:00.920
- Well, who told you?
- No one. I mean,
come on, Dad.
没人告诉我！爹，真的

00:02:01.094 --> 00:02:03.661
But if you knew, why didn't
you ever say anything?
你知道，为啥不吭声？

00:02:03.836 --> 00:02:05.794
Why didn't you say anything?
你为啥不吭声？

00:02:08.144 --> 00:02:10.843
How did I get here, Dad?
Where did I come from?
我怎么跑来这里，爹？我从哪儿来的？

00:02:12.627 --> 00:02:15.978
Actually, you came from this.
你从这里来的

00:02:20.026 --> 00:02:22.811
It was just another day
at the restaurant.
那天我照旧在店里忙着杆面

00:02:22.985 --> 00:02:25.205
Time to make the noodles.
那天我照旧在店里忙着杆面

00:02:25.379 --> 00:02:26.989
I went out to the back
去后面看刚送来的菜

00:02:27.163 --> 00:02:29.949
where my vegetables
had just been delivered.
去后面看刚送来的菜

00:02:30.123 --> 00:02:32.778
There were cabbages,
turnips, radishes.
有白菜，大萝卜，小萝卜

00:02:33.996 --> 00:02:36.607
Only there were no radishes...
不过小萝卜不见了

00:02:36.782 --> 00:02:40.133
...just a very hungry
baby panda.
只有个可爱的熊猫宝宝

00:02:41.395 --> 00:02:42.831
Whee!

00:02:43.005 --> 00:02:44.964
There was no note.
没有纸条

00:02:45.138 --> 00:02:47.314
Of course,
you could have eaten it.
当然，也说不定是被你吃了

00:02:47.488 --> 00:02:51.971
I waited for someone to come
looking for you
but no one did.
我等着人来找你

00:02:52.145 --> 00:02:54.016
[Po gurgles]
但没有人来

00:02:55.278 --> 00:02:57.237
[crying]

00:03:06.724 --> 00:03:08.683
[gurgles]

00:03:16.125 --> 00:03:18.084
[Ping] I brought you inside.
我把你带进来

00:03:20.651 --> 00:03:21.957
Fed you.
喂你

00:03:23.698 --> 00:03:25.091
Gave you a bath.
给你洗澡

00:03:28.181 --> 00:03:30.400
And fed you again.
再喂你吃

00:03:32.620 --> 00:03:34.883
And again.
再吃

00:03:35.057 --> 00:03:36.319
[playful whine]

00:03:36.493 --> 00:03:39.105
And tried to
put some pants on you.
然后想给你穿裤子

00:03:42.848 --> 00:03:44.850
[sobs and whimpers]

00:03:47.940 --> 00:03:51.160
And then I made a decision
that would change
my life forever.
接着我就做出改变我这辈子的重大决定

00:03:53.902 --> 00:03:55.991
To make my soup
without radishes...
就是煮汤不放萝卜

00:03:57.166 --> 00:04:00.387
...and to raise you
as my own son.
把你当亲生儿子一样养

00:04:01.605 --> 00:04:05.696
Xiao Po, my little panda.
小宝，我的小熊猫

00:04:05.871 --> 00:04:11.311
And from that moment on,
both my soup and my life
从那时起，我的汤和我的生活

00:04:11.485 --> 00:04:14.575
have been that much sweeter.
都变得甜蜜起来

00:04:14.749 --> 00:04:17.795
And, little Po,
that's the end of the story.
小宝，故事到此结束

00:04:17.970 --> 00:04:20.146
Ha! Look at me.
看看我，还是别看我

00:04:20.320 --> 00:04:22.191
No, don't look at me.
看看我，还是别看我

00:04:22.365 --> 00:04:25.412
That's it? That can't be it.
就这样？

00:04:25.586 --> 00:04:27.544
There's gotta be more, Dad!
不可能，肯定还有，讲嘛爹！

00:04:27.718 --> 00:04:31.113
Well, there was the time
you ate
all my bamboo furniture.
有一次你把我的竹子家具全吃了

00:04:31.287 --> 00:04:33.811
It was imported, too.
那还是进口的竹器呢

00:04:33.986 --> 00:04:36.553
One dumpling, please,
Dragon Warrior size.
来一份饺子，要龙战士分量

00:04:36.727 --> 00:04:38.729
[grunts]
来一份饺子，要龙战士分量

00:04:42.124 --> 00:04:45.954
Oh, Po, your story may
not have such
a happy beginning,
阿宝，你的故事虽没幸福开头，
但发展得不错

00:04:46.128 --> 00:04:47.651
but look how it turned out.
阿宝，你的故事虽没幸福开头，
但发展得不错

00:04:47.825 --> 00:04:50.089
You got me. You got kung fu.
你有我，还有功夫，还有面吃

00:04:50.263 --> 00:04:51.568
And you got noodles.
你有我，还有功夫，还有面吃

00:04:51.742 --> 00:04:54.397
I know. I just have
so many questions.
我知道，但我就是爱问

00:04:54.571 --> 00:04:56.965
Like, how did I ever fit
in this tiny basket?
比方说我怎能装进篮子？
为啥不爱穿裤子?

00:04:57.139 --> 00:04:58.793
Why didn't I like pants?
比方说我怎能装进篮子？
为啥不爱穿裤子?

00:05:01.143 --> 00:05:03.102
And who am I?
我是谁？

00:05:08.890 --> 00:05:10.109
[grunting]

00:05:10.283 --> 00:05:12.241
[male voice] Good.
Watch your form.
好，注意架势

00:05:14.940 --> 00:05:16.332
Good.
好

00:05:17.986 --> 00:05:19.945
Better. Elbow.

00:05:20.946 --> 00:05:22.948
Straighten it out!

00:05:31.957 --> 00:05:34.002
[all grunting, shouting]

00:05:34.176 --> 00:05:36.439
[all cry out in pain]

00:05:49.017 --> 00:05:50.932
Shen?
沈大人？

00:05:51.106 --> 00:05:54.066
Good afternoon, gentlemen.
下午好，各位

00:05:54.240 --> 00:05:56.851
Now we've got the
pleasantries out of the way,
客套够了，请别在我家逗留

00:05:57.025 --> 00:05:59.027
please leave my house.
客套够了，请别在我家逗留

00:05:59.201 --> 00:06:01.334
- Your house?
- Yes.
你家？

00:06:01.508 --> 00:06:03.945
Didn't you see the peacock
on the front door?
对，你没看见家门前有只孔雀？

00:06:04.902 --> 00:06:08.036
Ah, there you are, Soothsayer.
啊，你在这里，算卦大师

00:06:08.210 --> 00:06:13.433
It seems your fortune-telling
skills are not as good
as you thought.
看来你算卦本事不怎么样

00:06:13.607 --> 00:06:17.567
- We shall see, Shen.
- No, you shall see, old goat.
你等着瞧，老家伙，我们刚说到哪儿了？

00:06:17.741 --> 00:06:20.309
- Where were we?
- What do you want, Shen?
你等着瞧，老家伙，我们刚说到哪儿了？

00:06:20.483 --> 00:06:23.399
What is rightfully mine.
要属于我的东西

00:06:23.573 --> 00:06:25.488
Gongmen City!
拱门城！

00:06:25.662 --> 00:06:27.795
Gongmen is under
the stewardship
of the Masters' Council
现在由大师会掌管，我们会保护它

00:06:27.969 --> 00:06:29.318
and we will protect it.
现在由大师会掌管，我们会保护它

00:06:29.492 --> 00:06:31.755
Even from you.
哪怕是你想要也不行

00:06:31.929 --> 00:06:36.282
[chuckles] I'm so glad
you feel that way.
你这么看就好

00:06:36.456 --> 00:06:39.241
Otherwise, I'd have dragged
that here for nothing.
否则，我就白花力气把它带来了

00:06:39.415 --> 00:06:41.461
What's in the box, Shen?
箱子里有什么，阿沈？

00:06:41.635 --> 00:06:44.551
You want to see? It's a gift.
你想看？

00:06:45.421 --> 00:06:47.075
It's your parting gift.
给你的送别礼

00:06:47.249 --> 00:06:49.121
In that it will part you.
它会让你断裂

00:06:49.295 --> 00:06:50.905
Part of you here,
part of you there
这里一块，那里一块

00:06:51.079 --> 00:06:54.952
and part of you way over
there, staining the wall!
远远一块在那里，弄脏墙壁！

00:06:55.127 --> 00:06:56.432
You insolent fool!
你是个无礼的笨蛋！

00:06:56.606 --> 00:06:57.607
[grunts]

00:07:14.798 --> 00:07:15.843
Show-off.
爱显

00:07:16.017 --> 00:07:17.540
That is a warning.
这是对你的警告

00:07:17.714 --> 00:07:20.674
You are no match
for our kung fu.
你的功夫跟我们无法比

00:07:20.848 --> 00:07:22.763
I agree.
我同意

00:07:22.937 --> 00:07:24.591
But this is.
但这个能行

00:07:32.903 --> 00:07:33.904
[metallic snarl]

00:07:38.692 --> 00:07:41.347
Are you familiar with
the Master of Gongmen City?
你们熟悉拱门城的大师么？

00:07:41.521 --> 00:07:43.088
- Master Thundering Rhino?
- Yes.
轰雷犀牛大师？ 对

00:07:43.262 --> 00:07:45.699
- Son of Legendary
Flying Rhino?
- Yes.
传奇飞犀之子？ 对

00:07:45.873 --> 00:07:48.832
And Slayer of the Ten Thousand
Serpents in the Valley of Woe?
苦情谷的万蛇杀手？

00:07:49.006 --> 00:07:50.965
- He's dead.
- Whoa.
他死了 哇！

00:07:51.139 --> 00:07:52.967
[Crane] That's impossible.
这不可能

00:07:53.141 --> 00:07:55.012
Rhino's Horn Defense
is impervious
to any technique.
他的犄角功能对付任何技巧

00:07:55.187 --> 00:07:58.842
It was no technique.
Lord Shen has created
a weapon.
根本没有技巧，沈大人创造了一种武器

00:07:59.016 --> 00:08:01.106
One that breathes fire
and spits metal.
能喷火吐铁

00:08:01.280 --> 00:08:03.673
Unless he is stopped,
不阻止他，武林功夫界就完了

00:08:03.847 --> 00:08:06.676
this could be
the end of kung fu.
不阻止他，武林功夫界就完了

00:08:06.850 --> 00:08:11.377
- But I just got kung fu!
- And now you must save it.
现在你要拯救它

00:08:11.551 --> 00:08:15.511
Go! Destroy this weapon
and bring Lord Shen
to justice!
去吧！破坏他的武器，
将沈大人绳之以法！

00:08:15.685 --> 00:08:17.339
OK, here we go!
Here we go!
好，我们走！

00:08:17.513 --> 00:08:19.733
Whoa, whoa, whoa.
Wait a second.
哇！等等，叫我怎么办呢？

00:08:19.907 --> 00:08:20.821
How can I do this?
哇！等等，叫我怎么办呢？

00:08:20.995 --> 00:08:22.039
I mean,
how can kung fu
功夫怎能阻止毁灭功夫的东西？

00:08:22.214 --> 00:08:24.041
stop something
that stops kung fu?
功夫怎能阻止毁灭功夫的东西？

00:08:24.216 --> 00:08:25.913
Remember, Dragon Warrior,
记住，龙战士，
只要能做到心静如水就能战无不胜

00:08:26.087 --> 00:08:29.656
anything is possible
when you have inner peace.
记住，龙战士，
只要能做到心静如水就能战无不胜

